Domain Entity StudentSchoolAttendanceEvent
    documentation 'This event entity represents the recording of whether a student is in attendance 
                  'for a school day.
    include AttendanceEvent
        documentation 'Details of the AttendanceEvent.
        is required
    reference Student
        documentation 'Relates the Student associated with the AttendanceEvent.
        is part of identity
    reference School
        documentation 'Relates the School associated with the AttendanceEvent.
        is part of identity
    reference Session
        documentation 'Relates the Session associated with the AttendanceEvent.
        is part of identity
